--- a/Changes
+++ b/Changes
@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
+Local portability repair
+
+  * Wrap custom ops with XSPP_wrapped and their argument counts so that
+    PERL_RC_STACK builds balance argument and result reference counts.
+    Keep the original declarations when the wrapper API is unavailable.
+
+  * Test retained results, temporary handles, warnings and handle lifetime
+    after normal calls and exceptions.
+
 version 0.007; 2026-08-24
 
   * Fix test failure with USE_ITHREADS and DEBUGGING
